 DNP." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 300 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "a7d5c94d-c594-4eca-b978-f03d92c8f602"))  (text "Button inputs are direct. Each button LED uses one 2N7002 with no gate resistor or pull-down." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 310 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "cdc187ef-05f5-4e13-ad47-00dc9083cf72")) (text "TT and Center RGB data connect directly to RP2354B GPIO at 3.3 V; no AHCT buffer is fitted." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 315 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "b3d4bee5-d8e2-49e0-ad6c-cde727e8937d")) (text "UART A and B connect directly to RP2354B GPIO; use 3.3 V logic." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 320 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "9d210764-ddfb-4961-a721-1913da635488")) (text "Reset is available on J61 (RUN to GND). BOOTSEL is available on J60; SW2 is not populated." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 18 325 0.0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))) (uuid "e3d1fc53-38a6-4270-913d-dcb0ad05368f"))




